        {
            "title": "歐盟擬限制Airbnb等短租平台，應對住房短缺危機",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"歐盟擬限制Airbnb等短租平台，應對住房短缺危機\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/62b4a881ab85083a1516543a4881b08c4febec1aa8ad5ffcde63dca1b74dfe6d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXNPEC5S097_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">歐盟擬限制Airbnb等短租平台，應對住房短缺危機</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 為解決旅遊熱點地區的可負擔住房短缺問題，歐盟提出新方案，將對Airbnb等短期租賃平台實施更嚴格的限制。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此前，巴黎、巴塞隆納及威尼斯等城市已相繼採取各自的管制措施。為統一歐洲各地的監管標準，歐盟計劃制定統一規則。歐盟委員會副主席特蕾莎·里韋拉（Teresa Ribera）將於9月9日正式提出《可負擔住房法案》。該法案須經歐盟成員國及歐洲議會審議後方可正式生效。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">該草案確立了評估住房短缺的標準，以判斷何種情況下可對短期租賃實施限制。當局須透過房價收入比及其變化趨勢，並結合其他指標，評估住房壓力是否持續存在。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-4dc9bc7d-cd41-3d12-9905-cded06174be3-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據草案，房價收入比用於衡量購房成本與家庭收入之間的關係。官員還須考量人口增長情況，以及住房供需的動態變化。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">法案明確指出，任何限制措施均須符合非歧視性、相稱性及公共利益等原則。在住房緊張地區，設定數量上限或採用祖父條款等方式，可能比全面禁止購置或使用房產更為適宜。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%AD%90%E7%9B%9F%E6%93%AC%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6airbnb%E7%AD%89%E7%9F%AD%E7%A7%9F%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0-%E6%87%89%E5%B0%8D%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%BF%E7%9F%AD%E7%BC%BA%E5%8D%B1%E6%A9%9F-181402891.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-05 02:22:12",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "聯儲局官員哈馬克：現在是時候對抗通脹了",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"聯儲局官員哈馬克：現在是時候對抗通脹了\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/22d445ecec3525b9c7b8c5f3c7b74a7218ac8836b2be680a49ebf0fb6036fb6f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEM1J0VR_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">聯儲局官員哈馬克：現在是時候對抗通脹了</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 克利夫蘭聯邦儲備銀行行長貝絲·哈馬克（Beth Hammack）於週五表示，美國聯儲局需要採取行動以降低通脹。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">哈馬克在LinkedIn上發文分享了她的看法，指出當前數據及其轄區的報告顯示，現行貨幣政策對經濟的收緊力度仍然不足。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這位克利夫蘭聯儲行長是三位投票反對聯儲局7月維持利率不變決定的官員之一。她在週五的帖文中提到，曾與一位俄亥俄州東北部的製造商交流，該製造商呼籲聯儲局加息，原因是許多原材料投入價格的通脹率已達兩位數。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-f7f8bdb7-6f21-3129-a3b1-7912932093f2-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">聯邦公開市場委員會將於9月15日至16日召開會議，就利率走向作出決定。聯儲局官員將於午夜起進入通訊靜默期。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">週五公佈的強勁就業報告發布後，投資者目前預計聯儲局在9月會議上加息的概率略高於60%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%81%AF%E5%84%B2%E5%B1%80%E5%AE%98%E5%93%A1%E5%93%88%E9%A6%AC%E5%85%8B-%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%98%AF%E6%99%82%E5%80%99%E5%B0%8D%E6%8A%97%E9%80%9A%E8%84%B9%E4%BA%86-175027658.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-05 02:07:31",
