eak-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">63.2%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">69.6%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">強力買入評級；分析師上行空間顯著</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">漢蒙電力解決方案（Hammond Power Solutions Inc）</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">C$174.54</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">4.8%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">91.1%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">56.8%</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">持續跑贏大市；盈利表現強勁</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">龐巴迪動力產品（BRP Inc）</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] break-words lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">C$66.64</p></td><td class=\"border-divider-primary border p-[0.6em]\"><p class=\"text-px16 lg:text-px18 text-batcave leading-[1.63] brea